I know some people wake up in the morning, and the first thing they do, they always walk their dog, for example.

335
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,280
Oh, that's very nice.

336
00:17:08,280 --> 00:17:12,800
Other people are very hungry, so they almost always eat right when they wake up.

337
